{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"tower_softwood","model_identifier":"tower_softwood","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# tower_softwood\n\nSoftwood tower: a 3 x 3 column platform for ranged units, with a parapet and four standing points (`slot_tower_1..4`), a ladder or stair door at the back.\n\n- Footprint: 3 x 3 columns (48 x 48 units, 1.35 x 1.35 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -32..32, y 0..200, z -32..32 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 256, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 42, construction_0 15, construction_33 34, construction_66 46, ruined 13 (2 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 48 x 200 x 48 centred at the origin\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `tower_softwood_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `tower_softwood_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_tower_softwood` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, 36)\n- `slot_tower_1` at (-12, 124, -12)\n- `slot_tower_2` at (12, 124, -12)\n- `slot_tower_3` at (-12, 124, 12)\n- `slot_tower_4` at (12, 124, 12)\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"leg0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-24.0,0.0,-24.0],"to":[-18.0,140.0,-18.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[4.0,0.0,10.0,140.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[4.0,0.0,10.0,140.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[4.0,0.0,10.0,140.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[4.0,0.0,10.0,140.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[182.0,218.0,188.0,224.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[182.0,218.0,188.0,224.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"18a0cf60-53ba-5a30-a8b4-82085f1207fb"},{"name":"leg1","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[18.0,0.0,-24.0],"to":[24.0,140.0,-18.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[10.0,0.0,16.0,140.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[4.0,0.0,10.0,140.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[10.0,0.0,16.0,140.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[4.0,0.0,10.0,140.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[188.0,218.0,194.0,224.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[188.0,218.0,194.0,224.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"0518e132-3986-5758-aba6-6046232d90eb"},{"name":"leg2","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-24.0,0.0,18.0],"to":[-18.0,140.0,24.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[4.0,0.0,10.0,140.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[10.0,0.0,16.0,140.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[4.0,0.0,10.0,140.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[10.0,0.0,16.0,140.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[194.0,218.0,200.0,224.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[194.0,218.0,200.0,224.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"5662d938-5477-58b1-8ece-8f279df3e